title: '[pallet-revive]: short-circuit eth_estimate_gas for simple ETH transfers'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    closes https://github.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/issues/11888

    Skip the binary-search of dry-runs and return the fixed 21,000 gas cost when eth_estimate_gas is called for an EOA-to-EOA value transfer with empty calldata and no access list, EIP-7702 authorization list, EIP-4844 blob payload, or state overrides.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: patch
